      "notes": "Secondary type geometry. Performance and load figures in that article describe another airframe."
    },
    {
      "id": "AAEE-SPIT1-N3171",
      "aircraft": "Supermarine Spitfire I N.3171",
      "report": "A&AEE, N.3171 Rotol comparative performance trials, 19 March 1940",
      "location": "Summary of Trials, Climbing Trials and Speed Trials",
      "source": "https://www.wwiiaircraftperformance.com/org/spitcom/mk1/spitmk1_N.3171.html",
      "notes": "Period report transcription. The performance tables describe the as-delivered airframe with a projecting armoured windscreen, tank armour and domed hood. Further windscreen and RPM trials are separate."
    },
    {
      "id": "SPIT1-N3171-FIG2-SUMMARY",
      "aircraft": "Supermarine Spitfire I N.3171",
      "report": "WWII Aircraft Performance, Spitfire Mk I vs Bf 109 E",
      "location": "Level speed section and note 1d, citing N.3171 trials Fig. 2",
      "source": "https://wwiiaircraftperformance.com/org/spitcom/mk1/mk1-109e.html",
      "notes": "The 283 mph sea-level value comes from the modern summary. The period report's numerical speed table leaves sea level blank. This is the same campaign as AAEE-SPIT1-N3171."
    },
    {
      "id": "AAEE-SPITVA-X4922",
      "aircraft": "Supermarine Spitfire Va X.4922",
