      "source": "https://www.wwiiaircraftperformance.com/org/spitcom/mk5/spitmkVa_X4922.html",
      "notes": "Period report transcription including the correction to the test-load paragraph. Merlin XLV, standard Spitfire I de Havilland airscrew set to 34°/54°, eight Brownings, Mk II radiator."
    },
    {
      "id": "FW-A8-1944-10-25",
